        "name": "Paper Mario: The Thousand-Year Door",
        "summary": "A remake of the second game in the Paper Mario series, originally released for the Nintendo GameCube.\n\nTurn the page and join Mario and friends in an RPG adventure to discover the legendary treasure behind the ancient Thousand-Year Door. Will Mario complete his papery quest, or will he crumple under the pressure?",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cob9xy.jpg",
